Vendored from https://playground.babylonjs.com/textures/environment.env

This is a Babylon.js compressed prefiltered environment cubemap (.env format),
used for image-based lighting (IBL) of PBR materials in the OpenHarvest fancy
renderer. The Babylon.js project ships these textures as part of its public
assets under the Apache 2.0 license — same as the Babylon.js engine itself.

  https://github.com/BabylonJS/Babylon.js/blob/master/LICENSE.md
  Apache License, Version 2.0

We bundle this asset locally instead of hot-linking the CDN so the app stays
self-hosted (no external runtime dependency) and works offline / on the
homelab Tailnet.
